(b) Interference: Did some governmental act or omission interfere with the applicant's freedom of assembly? The government refused to approve the location of the picket (F025-F027, F028). That prevented the picket. Additionally, the authorities blocked his VKontakte account and blog entries (F036-F043, F049-F051). These are interferences with ability to organize and communicate about the assembly. So yes, there was interference.

